S584 four-term hidden-fold probe
Question: can 4-term structure with no visible 3-term fold hide information that reappears as virtual 3-folds?

Fixed hidden-sum deformation families: choose r disjoint pairs x+(s-x).
Rows with visible 3-term folds are filtered out.
